sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Sunita (user)
    participant W as Web app
    participant B as FastAPI backend
    participant G as Gemini API
    participant R as RDAP registry
    participant S as SQLite
    actor F as Family on WhatsApp

    U->>W: pastes the "VIP stock tips" message, language Hindi
    W->>B: POST /api/check {lang, anon_id, input}
    B->>B: validate input, rate limit (30 checks an hour per user)
    B->>S: same message + language checked before?
    alt cache hit
        S-->>B: saved verdict (answered in under 1 s)
    else new message
        par extract in parallel
            B->>B: regex: UPI IDs, phones, links, wallets
            B->>G: extract claims (each quote must appear word for word)
            B->>G: embed the message (script similarity)
            B->>R: domain age (2 s limit, never fetches the user's link)
        end
        B->>S: link context: salted HMAC identifiers vs earlier high-risk or reported checks
        S-->>B: linked checks (S4), near-copy script (S5)
        B->>B: score with fixed signals S1-S7 (code only), band: high risk / caution / no known signals
        B->>G: explain in Hindi, 2 sentences
        G-->>B: explanation
        B->>B: guards: right script, no made-up IDs, no invented reports, never "safe", else fixed text
        B->>S: save check (masked evidence, hashed identifiers), cache it
    end
    B-->>W: verdict, score, signals with evidence, next steps, share URL
    W-->>U: "High risk" + the exact lines that gave it away

    opt Listen
        U->>W: tap Listen
        W->>B: GET /api/check/{id}/audio
        B->>S: cached MP3?
        B->>G: text to speech (first time only)
        B->>B: ffmpeg to MP3, cache it
        B-->>W: audio/mpeg, played in Hindi
    end

    opt Share with family
        U->>W: tap Share
        W->>W: draw the card in Hindi, open the share sheet
        W->>B: event share_clicked
        U->>F: forwards the card and link
        F->>B: GET /c/{id}?ref=... (share page, with audio)
        B->>S: event ref_visit (counts toward k-factor on /stats)
    end

    opt Report
        U->>W: tap Report (optionally consent to keep the text)
        W->>B: POST /api/report
        B->>S: report linked to the check's identifiers
        Note over B,S: The next person who checks the same UPI ID, number or website is warned (S4)
    end
